@startuml
title RF36 — Simular a temporada pelo calendário · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
control "AuditService" as AuditService
control "MatchSimulator" as MatchSimulator
control "PlayCaller" as PlayCaller
control "SeasonEngine" as SeasonEngine
control "SimulationRunner" as SimulationRunner
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Cassandra 4.1" as Cassandra
participant "Agendador/Job assíncrono" as Scheduler
Manager -> Frontend: Simular até o fim da semana 9
Frontend -> API: POST /careers/{id}/simulate {until: WEEK, targetWeek: 9, speed: FAST}
API -> UseCase: StartSimulationUseCase.execute
UseCase -> MySQL: SimulationRun ativa?
alt já existe
  API --> Frontend: 409 SIMULATION_ACTIVE
else livre
  UseCase -> MySQL: SimulationRun QUEUED
  UseCase -> AuditService: SEASON_SIMULATION_STARTED
  API --> Frontend: 202 {runId}
end
Scheduler -> SimulationRunner: step(run)
loop semana a semana até o alvo
  SimulationRunner -> MatchSimulator: joga a semana (seed = mix(seed, fixtureId), chamadas automáticas)
  MatchSimulator -> PlayCaller: chamada nos momentos decisivos (IA)
  SimulationRunner -> SeasonEngine: classificação, moral, lesões, finanças
  SimulationRunner -> Cassandra: timeline e play-by-play da semana
  alt parada obrigatória
    SimulationRunner -> MySQL: PAUSED (pauseReason)
  end
end
Frontend -> API: GET /simulate/{runId} (poll)
API --> Frontend: progresso X/Y · resumo
@enduml
